  "stem_markdown": "5． 已知函数$f(x)$在定义域内可导，$f(x)$的大致图象如图所示，则其导函数$f^'(x)$的大致图象可能为（    ）\nA．[image:rId8] B．[image:rId9] C．[image:rId10] D．[image:rId11]",
  "stem_text": "5． 已知函数f(x)在定义域内可导，f(x)的大致图象如图所示，则其导函数f^'(x)的大致图象可能为（    ）\nA．[image:rId8] B．[image:rId9] C．[image:rId10] D．[image:rId11]",
  "stem_html": "<p>5． 已知函数<span class=\"formula\" data-formula-id=\"f001\">f(x)</span>在定义域内可导，<span class=\"formula\" data-formula-id=\"f002\">f(x)</span>的大致图象如图所示，则其导函数<span class=\"formula\" data-formula-id=\"f003\">f^&#x27;(x)</span>的大致图象可能为（    ）</p>\n<p>A．<img src=\"assets/szzx2024g2week5_q005_image_01.png\" alt=\"img001\"> B．<img src=\"assets/szzx2024g2week5_q005_image_02.png\" alt=\"img002\"> C．<img src=\"assets/szzx2024g2week5_q005_image_03.png\" alt=\"img003\"> D．<img src=\"assets/szzx2024g2week5_q005_image_04.png\" alt=\"img004\"></p>",
